 "_about": "WINCTRL URSA MINOR Combat Throttle Metal.EX: where SimAppPro stores its lighting (read with Winwing opcode 0x05). 3 groups of 12 LEDs (red, green, blue, level). Which part each LED lights comes from SimAppPro2's own definition of this throttle (T-N-N-5-1 Base, part 47424 = 0xB940: key backlight 0x00, labels 0x04, B8 to B1 0x08 to 0x24, mode selected 0x28, mode others 0x2C). Settings: three inputs SimAppPro lets you set to key, axis or both (base word 0xEC bytes 0 and 1, right grip word 0xF0 byte 0); which physical controls they are is not known yet.",
